ics-oral/minimal-pair-drills/\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Minimal-pair Drills</a></h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Practical drills for perception and production.</p></div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Phonetics &amp; Oral English | English</title>\n  \n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <style> body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);}</style>\n\n\n  <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-6\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to English</a></nav>\n    <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Phonetics &amp; Oral English</h1>\n    <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-6\">IPA basics, vowel &amp; consonant sounds, stress and intonation practice.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n      <article class=\"card p-5 rounded-lg\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/phonetics-oral/\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">IPA Basics</a></h2>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Intro to the International Phonetic Alphabet and transcription.</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card p-5 rounded-lg\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/english/phonetics-oral/\" class=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Stress &amp; Intonation</a></h2>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Patterns of sentence stress and intonation for meaning.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-50 to-orange-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.card{ -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.82)